== Icelandic ==
{{Icelandic declension hk sb 03|öryggisbelt}}
===Etymology===
From {{gen}} of ''[[öryggi]]''; ''[[öryggis]]'' "of [[safety]]" + ''[[belti]]'' meaning "[[belt]]". Thus "safety's belt" or "belt of safety".

=== Noun ===
'''öryggisbelti''' ''n.''

# [[safety belt]], [[seat belt]]

